  - Ah, your next lesson arrives. Here, you must learn to harness the power of the
    tongue. You know I can see you sticking it out at me! Yes indeed, I have means
    of observing you that you have never before seen.
  - Why not- Well I shall hardly scry the locations and ruin your challenge! I most
    certainly do have the power, thanking you kindly!
